    "Con datos móviles": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On cellular data"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con datos móviles te avisamos antes de usar fuentes de más de %lld GB.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On cellular we ask before using sources over %lld GB."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con datos móviles te avisamos antes de usar fuentes de más de 5 GB.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On cellular data we warn you before using sources over 5 GB."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con datos móviles te avisamos antes de usar versiones de más de %lld GB.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On cellular we'll ask before using versions over %lld GB."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con ella Orbital puede pedir videos a tu cuenta.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With it, Orbital can request videos from your account."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con géneros elegidos, el ánimo no cuenta.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With genres picked, the mood doesn't count."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con la app abierta baja a toda velocidad; con la app cerrada iOS la frena mucho. Para bajar rápido, deja Orbital abierta: al salir, sigue sola, más lento.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With the app open it downloads at full speed; with the app closed iOS slows it down a lot. To download fast, keep Orbital open: when you leave, it keeps going on its own, slower."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con subtítulos para este video": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With subtitles for this video"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con tu Orbital conectada, «Ver en la TV» pone en la consola lo que ves aquí, donde ibas, y las claves de Para ti salen de ella. Trakt se conecta aparte en cada uno.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With your Orbital connected, “Watch on TV” plays what you're watching here on the console, right where you were, and your For You keys come from it. Trakt is connected separately on each one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con tu Orbital conectada, «Ver en la TV» pone en la consola lo que ves aquí, donde ibas. Trakt se conecta aparte en cada uno.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With your Orbital connected, “Watch on TV” plays on the console what you're watching here, where you left off. Trakt is connected separately on each."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conecta Trakt": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connect Trakt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conecta Trakt (en tu Orbital o en Ajustes) para ver tu año.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
